    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tanbo&quot; is a short walking simulator horror game in which you take a walk along a rice paddy path at night with your dog, Bonta.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a summer night after a typhoon has passed. As usual, you take Bonta for a walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, your walks with Bonta become stranger day by day, and strange things start happening around you...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an adventure game in which you move and work from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic game is to take your dog, Bonta, for a walk along a rice paddy path, and when you get home, prepare water and food for Bonta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a game over, so be careful of any strange occurrences you may encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of Endings: 2</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action: E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu: M</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text forwarding: Space bar</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStreaming is possible without permission from individuals or corporations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMonetization is only possible if you use the functions provided by the video streaming site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWe would appreciate it if you could include the name of the game in the title of your video or stream, and include a link to the Steam page in the description section or elsewhere. (This is optional.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not responsible for any damages caused by streaming videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contents of this guideline may change without notice.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tanbo&quot; is a short walking simulator horror game in which you take a walk along a rice paddy path at night with your dog, Bonta.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a summer night after a typhoon has passed. As usual, you take Bonta for a walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, your walks with Bonta become stranger day by day, and strange things start happening around you...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an adventure game in which you move and work from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic game is to take your dog, Bonta, for a walk along a rice paddy path, and when you get home, prepare water and food for Bonta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a game over, so be careful of any strange occurrences you may encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of Endings: 2</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action: E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu: M</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text forwarding: Space bar</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStreaming is possible without permission from individuals or corporations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMonetization is only possible if you use the functions provided by the video streaming site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWe would appreciate it if you could include the name of the game in the title of your video or stream, and include a link to the Steam page in the description section or elsewhere. (This is optional.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not responsible for any damages caused by streaming videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contents of this guideline may change without notice.</p>",
